'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Deciding whether to ask
participant MishMash
participant Parser
participant "Plan-changing command" as Command
participant ActiveMealPlan as Active
MishMash -> Parser : parseCommand(input)
Parser --> MishMash : validated command
MishMash -> Command : confirmationPrompt(recipeBook)
Command -> Active : read current state
Active --> Command : plan state
Command --> MishMash : Optional question
note over Command, Active
  Reads state without changing it.
  Prompt conditions are listed in the guide.
end note
alt question present
  ref over MishMash, Command : Accepted change or cancellation
else no question
  MishMash -> Command : execute(recipeBook)
  Command --> MishMash : feedback or recoverable error
end
@enduml
'@@author
